-- title:
--   Halving weights
-- statement:
--   The halving weights are
--   $$
--   \omega_j=\Bigl(\tfrac12\Bigr)^{j+1}\qquad(j\in\mathbb N),
--   $$
--   so $\omega_0=\tfrac12$, $\omega_1=\tfrac14,\dots$ and $\sum_j\omega_j=1$. They serve as summable error tolerances in the construction of weakly unconditionally Cauchy families of test functions.
